# FORMA environment variables — names and placeholders only. NEVER commit real values.
# Each app reads its own file:
#   apps/mobile/.env      (EXPO_PUBLIC_* — public, bundled into the app)
#   apps/admin/.env.local (NEXT_PUBLIC_* — public, bundled into the console)
#   functions/.env        (server-only settings for Cloud Functions)
# AI provider API keys are NOT environment variables: add them in the Admin
# Console (AI Providers). They are stored in Google Secret Manager.
# See apps/mobile/.env.example, apps/admin/.env.example and functions/.env.example.
